{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测Windows经PowerShell添加Defender排除项。对应需求：防御规避。官方：Windows Defender Exclusions Added via PowerShell。","from":"now-9m","index":["endgame-*","logs-crowdstrike.fdr*","logs-endpoint.events.process-*","logs-m365_defender.event-*","logs-sentinel_one_cloud_funnel.*","logs-system.security*","logs-windows.forwarded*","logs-windows.sysmon_operational-*","winlogbeat-*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Windows经PowerShell添加Defender排除项","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nWindows经PowerShell添加Defender排除项\n\n### 为何重要\n绕过防护、伪装或擦痕\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对进程名、命令行、父进程、用户与事件ID。\n2. 核对路径、注册表、外连地址与是否符合变更窗口。\n3. 关联同主机前后同类告警、落地文件与凭据操作。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、软件分发或安全工具\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离主机、终止可疑进程并排查落地文件与账号。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警与外连。\n","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 Windows 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（按规则需要进程/网络/文件/注册表或安全日志）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","references":["https://www.bitdefender.com/files/News/CaseStudies/study/400/Bitdefender-PR-Whitepaper-MosaicLoader-creat5540-en-EN.pdf","https://www.elastic.co/security-labs/elastic-security-uncovers-blister-malware-campaign","https://www.elastic.co/security-labs/operation-bleeding-bear","https://www.elastic.co/security-labs/invisible-miners-unveiling-ghostengine"],"risk_score":47,"rule_id":"2c17e5d7-08b9-43b2-b58a-0270d65ac85b","severity":"medium","tags":["操作系统: Windows","主题: 防御规避","来源: 默认","对应需求: 防御规避"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"process where host.os.type == \"windows\" and event.type == \"start\" and\n (process.name : (\"powershell.exe\", \"pwsh.exe\", \"powershell_ise.exe\") or ?process.pe.original_file_name in (\"PowerShell.EXE\", \"pwsh.dll\", \"powershell_ise.EXE\")) and\n  process.args : (\"*Add-MpPreference*\", \"*Set-MpPreference*\") and\n  process.args : (\"*-Exclusion*\")\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1562","name":"Impair Defenses","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1562/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1562.001","name":"Disable or Modify Tools","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1562/001/"},{"id":"T1562.006","name":"Indicator Blocking","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1562/006/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0005","name":"Defense Evasion","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0005/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1059","name":"Command and Scripting Interpreter","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1059.001","name":"PowerShell","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/001/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0002","name":"Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0002/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、软件分发或安全工具"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"},{"package":"windows","version":"*"},{"package":"system","version":"*"},{"package":"m365_defender","version":"*"},{"package":"sentinel_one_cloud_funnel","version":"*"},{"package":"crowdstrike","version":"*"}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","process.parent.executable","event.action","event.code","file.path","registry.path","source.ip","destination.ip","winlog.event_data.TargetUserName","message"]},"version":320,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now"}
